<title>JAPAN: Hokkai Can -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokkai Can -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 38.29		vs	   38.32</p>
<p> Operating	    1.20		vs	    1.10</p>
<p> Current	    864    million	  vs	  831    million</p>
<p> Net		  452    million	  vs	  427    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.78 yen	  vs	    6.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     67 million	  vs	  67 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkai Can Co Ltd manufactures cans for canned foods.</p>
</text>
